    <Property ID="3" Name="Relevant Fixlets">number of relevant fixlets whose (not exists values of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it or (value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;task&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;analysis&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;baseline&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Source&quot; of it != &quot;Internal&quot;)) of sites whose (name of it = &quot;My Custom Site&quot;)</Property>
    <Property ID="4" Name="Fixlets">(if number of relevant fixlets whose (not exists values of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it or (value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;task&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;analysis&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Source&quot; of it != &quot;Internal&quot;)) of sites whose (name of it = &quot;My Custom Site&quot;) as string = &quot;0&quot; then &quot;Fully Patched&quot; else values of headers &quot;Subject&quot; of relevant fixlets whose (not exists values of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it or (value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;task&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Type&quot; of it as lowercase != &quot;analysis&quot; and value of headers &quot;X-Fixlet-Source&quot; of it != &quot;Internal&quot;)) of sites whose (name of it = &quot;My Custom Site&quot;))</Property>
  </Analysis>
